# Pin LF for everything under fdroid/.
#
# Without this, Windows clones with `core.autocrlf=true` end up with CRLF
# in the working tree, which leaks into the fdroiddata fork when the user
# copies these files over and breaks F-Droid's `fdroid rewritemeta` check
# (`^M` markers all over the YAML diff). Forcing LF here means cp from our
# working tree always lands LF in fdroiddata.
* text=auto eol=lf
